Note projections_note {
  '''
  PUBLIC HISTORY READ MODELS ARE INTENTIONALLY NOT CANONICAL TABLES.

  Driver career, current team, wins, podiums, championships,
  Team trophy cabinets and aggregate statistics are derived projections.

  They may later be materialized/cached for performance, but the canonical
  source of truth remains the entities, memberships, result revisions,
  standing revisions and their provenance represented in this model.
  '''
}
